{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd9d50241084246ce50bf6d7f2dfb6b16220cd089a743e4c1528ce275e5eebcb", "ja": "センターとはすなわち主人公！\nはりきる百合子だったが、日夜繰り広げられ\nる仲間たちとの特訓は前途多難！　メンバー\nに支えられつつ困難に耐え抜いた百合子は、\n仲間たちと共にステージを成功させる！", "zh": "Center也就是所谓的主角！\n百合子卯足全力练习，\n但她和同伴日以继夜进行的特训却前途多舛！\n在团员的支持下，跨越重重困难的百合子，\n和同伴一起成功完成表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cd6888b7f75e09d149b4c4aa13f75286653ffb90dca2811aefee143815cb475f", "ja": "（百合子のセンター公演が、無事終了した。\n拍手と歓声が、ここまで聞こえてくる……）", "zh": "（百合子的Center公演顺利结束了。\n连这边也听得见掌声与欢呼声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "1cc83a18fe24539c96bcee1eb3feeaeb0c64aa2cf95cc0c553d275647403b8a5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c4bf07b8b6291e1d6ab5b806434134ae3aebd4e77acc64245beb261de44b3f58", "ja": "百合子、お疲れさま。\n初センター公演、どうだった？", "zh": "百合子，辛苦你了。\n第一次的Center公演，感觉如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "e95bfc25562d2d5f3cabd63b1a4c6853da6d68e716cdb2b50a24601fc19ea855", "ja": "お、お疲れさまです！\nあの、わ、私……うまく、言えないんですけどっ。", "zh": "辛、辛苦你了！\n那个，我、我……我也不知道该怎么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "d0da2518d4162cc5c90e60919c581a959caab2c4faa337c6e575f9ede4b71724", "ja": "すごく……すごく、楽しかったです！\nステージもみんなも、キラキラ眩しくって……！", "zh": "就是……非常、非常开心！\n不管是舞台还是所有人，全都好闪亮、好耀眼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "f188dd3439c1434741ebea629ff19f57570e0a1023708b408b40cdd0c48d8a35", "ja": "本当に、今さらかもしれないんですけど。\n私、本当にアイドルになったんだ……って思って……。", "zh": "老实说，现在才说这个，可能真的有点晚了。\n但我终于开始觉得，自己真的成为偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a6f92089eb42d64d290d81794a16c19994e17b51d313669347ac4548704515f6", "ja": "そうだな。百合子はアイドルになった。\nそして今日、立派にセンターを務めたんだ。", "zh": "是啊，百合子已经是偶像了。\n而且今天还是位很优秀的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "ea925ea2c935f2c43616c0c0816a9e4ddde53f5a957b426148540d1192c4670a", "ja": "～～……はいっ！", "zh": "……是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "f030307f6eb08cbb726dd5f8665a5ae4999e8132dec00fe6e111b114eec8ca3b", "ja": "あ……いた……。\n百合子さん……。", "zh": "啊……找到了……\n百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "888ef37529f870050eed5821d9cb1c447c078f210fbe8f4321f5241bb76b6b16", "ja": "あっ、杏奈ちゃん！\n紗代子さん、志保も……。", "zh": "啊，小杏！\n还有纱代子、志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "308285e104560def81a2e127523daa5355da3ea4a13b9f9497bac2cca020a705", "ja": "百合子さんの、ダンス……\nすごく……かっこよかった……。", "zh": "百合子的舞……\n跳得……非常帅气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "c2635b9b24f9e04e313be5553bf4129cced69a30b306d46ff8327ed7a8eda863", "ja": "うん！　特訓の成果がちゃんと出てたと思う！\n百合子、すっごくキラキラしてたよ！", "zh": "嗯！有彻底发挥出特训的成果！\n百合子整个人都很耀眼喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "be1e40c86693c98239a6bb545ee1ba3171dc86b3df6d87ea0756a9907b58a460", "ja": "会場の盛り上がり方を見れば、\n成功じゃないですか。よかったですね。", "zh": "看会场气氛的热烈程度，\n算很成功吧，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "edca7281dbdcbe369c1468aed388540edd5b0e420ca27f9477a16481b36cc288", "ja": "本当？　お客さん達、喜んでくれてた？\n……よかったぁ～……。", "zh": "真的吗？观众都很高兴？\n……太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
