{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "73bca55ed33431aa2672adae33d0d6156e35fe31db01e891c3e9eb0c9db4fd4b", "ja": "キラキラして、眩しくて……\nみんなが希望を抱くような、そんな、アイドルに。", "zh": "成为一名闪亮耀眼……\n能够让大家感受到希望，那样的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
