{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_2000_p", "source_sha256": "796c1251dc6eeeb9f7085bd8b6d59d5fecfd3f22a4e6f7e515420ebc583d605c", "ja": "もちろん！　ファンのみんなが、百合子を見て、\n幸せな気持ちになれる……そんなアイドルだったよ。", "zh": "当然！粉丝们看着百合子，\n就能感到幸福……你就是那样的偶像喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_006_2001_026yur", "source_sha256": "1158c669e04ac4b74ac33eadf58ee31b4e1ad24e2e3e2aee57f2e371636a0524", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nありがとうございます！　私、いつか……", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n谢谢你！我总有一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
